## Hook touchpoints

- **sessionStart** — `session-start-routing-hint.py` injects Cursor slice + any Vellum routing hint from marker
- **sessionStart** — `session-start-vellum-intent.py` nudge includes routing sidecar fields on PLAN
- **beforeSubmitPrompt** — constitutional + prompt lint (existing)
- **subagentStop** — parent must reconcile subagent output; Cursor thread stays owner
- **stop** — ACTUAL references plan + routing decisions taken

